    "body": "@gmaghera In my `.zshrc` file I had a definition of `PROMPT` which somehow conflicted with starship. That custom prompt was easily replaced by using the `status` module of starship. Therefore, I just removed the `PROMPT` entry from my `.zshrc` and that solved my problem.",
